Error [jet.DriverOperationFailed]: This compiler has no identity: `JET_COMPILER_IDENTITY` is not set and `{work}/tool/IDENTITY` names none
 Why: Jet could not complete the named file, tool, or operating-system operation
 Fix: Set `JET_COMPILER_IDENTITY` to the compiler's `name@version#build-id`, or write that one line to `{work}/tool/IDENTITY`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2105
